<title>USA: MPSI cites software development delays.</title>
<headline>MPSI cites software development delays.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>MPSI Systems Inc said delays in software development under its previous organizational structure were partly responsible for the downturn in fiscal 1996 results.</p>
<p>The computer software company on September 30 reported fourth-quarter earnings of $68,000, or $0.02 per share, compared with a year-earlier earnings of $878,000, or $0.31 per share. The 1996 results included a $215,000 charge for a corporate restructuring completed in July 1996.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
